  "postText": "<p><HTML><HEAD><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"></HEAD><body></p>\n<div align=\"center\">こさめです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/N5JcDvPSRywfR9t3asg7cXyq9javLiu13izpCnxKTtmJxUkKurBKxHKSe9X6vpS7uNsg2pTzrvdYi7AKQhkb9WRBbHWXN7usqS1Q7mFDaJNcOcX3nzqA0NNnW61wGrhP6fs32XStCdjGMskJc8Cn1lRbN7d6F1I4WTLzzC9Mof8ZmE0EEQBdEA4fCMNRpS8luiVfeFql\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/72/ab7c2dab124087b6d333fd6d0c291d8d..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">さむい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんとにさむい</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">寒いのは百歩譲って許すけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">風はなに</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">破壊されるかと思った😿</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ほんとにほんとに冬が好きじゃないです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">寒いし、なんか寂しい気持ちなるし</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">でも冬の曲は好きかもしれない</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">それこそSnow halationとか</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">めちゃめちゃ好きです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">寒い時とか元気ない時とかは</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">HoneyWorksさんの曲を聞きます</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">HoneyWorksさんの曲は真っ直ぐで素直で、分かりやすくて</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">全部好き！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なにより私は青春コンプレックスを拗らせているので、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">学園系の曲を聞く度に胸が締め付けられるのですが</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">それが、いい‼️</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">青春コンプレックスって言ってるけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">結局最後まで自分から動かなかっただけだなって</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今ではおもう∩^ω^∩</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/numRioQ2YNY4jirF93WXCVpWqSnG4dJJl000S9555DJfe3wl6YTQVxxIuUmU9WGXgX14jb9WDE1fvmXL4zSrzf0T7ql8crMz8OKNLCh3K1I0jRe0sSr0JwtNGeU5Ha2gu95pEWLBs8G3O9DBKhbhhymAAQg4FUyUX5BmKhng9dBqod3x8Rqhdrjt79EpylbwZW6tHE4s\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/72/e375595809ffd9bdfc32410ddb4f56b5..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/HOw7MhPZn31Zz6BrpyI1EtiG0g6NwxTBUqsqkpQ9bYWRQS67ovstPDpsex1sU7BfbKNkn7jL8MWHxbYucV1bhrd2vGd3ABqZn4BcMfmGzIDxbnRvIw7urGbYWkBPgMhMJRtqzAL3IK3jNdeaus1Ra88eU8zdq4KQX5ZIDzsZNNpjQesunCFWyXYq8zc5nkP2TpZGKwze\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/72/7d2ddbbd4186f2311bf9869302851e14..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://dcimg.awalker.jp/v/YJyxCW97NiLiKG7CPhktKwailfusWd7HqYM7VzTnqW8d1dTH7s6yrj0luB0xyC5SqbLZ3VRUV9tak7YQQj3673aFJFQiC7XvORFrI9isSojypBetpiqlLKjf9FD2Ezi9mAvybNBgWR3f4OqgAd3bxDPLjEnL2gSc28fmuWQimAnFJFdNp9lmBJwz2RsEO1f9RA0pGLlH\"><img src=\"/blog/wp-content/uploads/mail-contents/2142/72/92a5f874f31445b2e29604070604aa17..jpg\"></a></div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">HoneyWorksさんが作る曲は、</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">今どき手が出しづらい珍しいジャンルな気がします</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">なんだかんだ感情むき出し曲が</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">1番作るのが難しいと思う</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">だから本当に大好き</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">（Chu!） なんだね……♪</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">遠回りせず</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">好きな人には好きって伝えるべきだけど</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">意外とそれがいちばん難しいよね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">(^^♪</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">そういえば今日で初お給仕から100日だったみたいです！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">ありがとうー！</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">節目が沢山でうれしーです</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">これからもよろしくね</div>\n<div align=\"center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div align=\"center\">おやふみ</div>\n<p></body></HTML></p>\n",
